/notes/

# Per-user agent state (Claude Code). Shared instructions live in AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md /
# .agents/, which ARE versioned; .claude/skills is a symlink to .agents/skills.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
